Instruction on how you created the tools isolation for this product.
Please include platform you installed on, where you installed it, what
you copied where, etc.:

1. Access the library from http://www-01.ibm.com/software/webservers/appserv/was/featurepacks/web20-mobile/
2. One you download, extract it. There you will find a file - fep.web2mobfep.70.pak. Extract that with WinRAR and under that go to
    repository\lib.jaxrs_1.1.70\web2mobilefep_1.1\optionalLibraries\jaxrs_1.X\jackson and there you will find multiple jars. 

Copy these jars to the adks/codehaus/jackson directory:
jackson-core-asl.jar
jackson-jaxrs.jar
jackson-mapper-asl.jar
jackson-xc.jar

check them into cmvc
